# graphql-audit Rule

1. Follow `.agents/skills/graphql-audit/references/graphql_checklist.md` (GQL-001 to GQL-015, GQL-V-*). Queries: `references/graphql_queries.md`.
2. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET`, then `.agents/skills/graphql-audit/scripts/gql_probe.py`; authorization tests via `--ops-file` with two own accounts.
3. Mutations only on your own disposable objects (`--allow-mutations`); large cost tests and brute force via batching are authorized-only.
